[keri_aetheros_borealis://<name>]
base_url = Enter the base URL for the Keri API endpoint.
credentials = Choose the credentials to use to authenticate.
tenant_name = Enter the Name of the Tenant. This can be found on the "Manage Systems" page in the Borealis UI.
site_name = Enter the name of the Site from Sites page in the Borealis UI.
page_size = Retrieve events in blocks of this size.
timeout = Enter the timeout, in seconds, to wait for events to be returned from Borealis. (NOTE: On initial load of historical events, this could take many minutes due the size of the data.)
timestamp_start = On initial load, only retrieve events starting from this timestamp. ISO 8601 format (e.g. "2026-07-11T18:30:00-04:00")